00:56:02,332 --> 00:56:04,000
Amy .

503
00:56:04,084 --> 00:56:06,169
Excuse me , I have to go .

504
00:56:07,504 --> 00:56:12,134
DOCTOR : Tell me about Esseker , Terrence . Who is Esseker ?

505
00:56:12,217 --> 00:56:14,845
I don 't know who Esseker is !

506
00:56:15,887 --> 00:56:18,557
I don 't know who Esseker is !

507
00:56:20,183 --> 00:56:21,518
I don 't know .

508
00:56:29,818 --> 00:56:31,945
ROSA : Mrs. Carson ? It 's Rosa .

509
00:56:32,612 --> 00:56:37,492
( WHISPERING ) Mr. Ben is here . He 's moving all of the furniture around .

510
00:57:10,733 --> 00:57:13,528
- Hey . How was school today ? - Good .

511
00:57:13,611 --> 00:57:15,863
Good . I 'll be right back .

512
00:57:27,458 --> 00:57:28,501
Dad ...

513
00:57:28,584 --> 00:57:32,213
BEN : Sweetheart , just give me a second . I gotta take care of a couple of things .

514
00:57:54,735 --> 00:57:56,821
Daddy , what are you doing ?

515
00:57:59,698 --> 00:58:01,992
Honey , don 't look scared . Everything 's fine .

516
00:58:02,076 --> 00:58:04,954
I think it looks nicer like this . Don 't you ?

517
00:58:21,428 --> 00:58:23,514
AMY : Rosa , what 's happening ?

518
00:58:23,806 --> 00:58:27,017
Take the kids downstairs , right now . Right now .

519
00:58:27,559 --> 00:58:28,644
What the hell are you doing ?

520
00:58:28,727 --> 00:58:30,938
Amy , you 're gonna have to trust me . This is for your own protection .

521
00:58:31,021 --> 00:58:33,357
Get out of the house , right now !

522
00:58:33,482 --> 00:58:36,527
Hey , are you listening to me ? You are scaring the kids !

523
00:58:36,610 --> 00:58:38,112
If you don 't leave immediately , I 'm calling the police ,

524
00:58:38,195 --> 00:58:40,155
and I warn you , you will never see your kids again !

525
00:58:40,239 --> 00:58:42,574
Amy , I am not crazy . These mirrors are dangerous .

526
00:58:42,658 --> 00:58:45,661
At first I thought it was just the ones in the store , but after Angela was killed ,

527
00:58:45,744 --> 00:58:46,995
I realized they can get at you anywhere .

528
00:58:47,079 --> 00:58:50,999
I promise I will leave the house . Just let me cover these damn mirrors .

529
00:58:51,083 --> 00:58:53,001
What 's wrong with you ?

530
00:58:54,211 --> 00:58:56,338
I know what you 've been going through hasn 't been easy .

531
00:58:56,421 --> 00:59:00,008
But guess what ? It hasn 't been easy for us , either !

532
00:59:00,092 --> 00:59:03,053
Angela was a part of our lives , too , you know that ?

533
00:59:03,136 --> 00:59:05,972
It 's not fair what you 're doing to us , Ben !

534
00:59:06,056 --> 00:59:09,810
Michael ... He 's acting so strange now .

535
00:59:09,893 --> 00:59:13,897
He always wants to be alone . He won 't talk to me . He 's having nightmares .

536
00:59:13,980 --> 00:59:16,858
Ben , your behavior is rubbing off on him !

537
00:59:16,942 --> 00:59:19,861
He is six years old . I have to protect him !

538
00:59:20,070 --> 00:59:22,322
I want to show you something .

539
00:59:25,214 --> 00:59:26,799
- Ben , let go of me ! - You don 't want to believe me ?

540
00:59:26,882 --> 00:59:27,925
Fine , I 'll show you .

541
00:59:28,009 --> 00:59:30,469
- What are you doing ? - I 'll show you !

542
00:59:32,096 --> 00:59:33,597
Are you crazy ?

543
00:59:35,891 --> 00:59:38,060
- Have you gone completely mad ? - Just wait , you 'll see .

544
00:59:38,144 --> 00:59:39,979
- See what ? - You 'll see .

545
00:59:40,646 --> 00:59:43,649
See what , Ben ? What am I supposed to see ?

546
00:59:51,657 --> 00:59:53,409
It 's not happening .

547
00:59:54,451 --> 00:59:56,245
It 's not happening .

548
00:59:56,453 --> 00:59:59,248
Amy , I swear to you , at the Mayflower ...

549
01:00:02,334 --> 01:00:04,169
I am not lying .

550
01:00:20,018 --> 01:00:23,105
Ben . Let 's go back inside , okay ?

551
01:00:26,650 --> 01:00:28,485
Put the gun away .

552
01:00:30,571 --> 01:00:34,032
Listen to me , baby . I want to help you .

553
01:00:34,491 --> 01:00:36,118
Tell the kids I 'm sorry .

554
01:00:36,201 --> 01:00:37,411
AMY : Ben !

555
01:00:38,245 --> 01:00:39,788
( AMY GASPING )

556
01:00:42,165 --> 01:00:44,167
( CAR ENGINE STARTING )

557
01:01:05,730 --> 01:01:07,107
( SCREAMS )

558
01:01:08,275 --> 01:01:09,442
( TRUCK HONKING )

559
01:01:09,526 --> 01:01:10,569
No !

560
01:01:17,409 --> 01:01:19,202
( TIRES SCREECHING )

561
01:02:50,167 --> 01:02:51,669
( TILE CLINKS )

562
01:03:19,446 --> 01:03:20,864
( GRUNTING )

563
01:04:58,378 --> 01:04:59,963
Jesus Christ .

564
01:05:38,292 --> 01:05:39,794
( SCREAMING )

565
01:05:53,182 --> 01:05:55,142
Larry , it 's me . I need your help again .

566
01:05:55,226 --> 01:05:58,771
I 'm trying to locate the patient-employee manifest for St. Matthew 's Hospital .

567
01:05:58,854 --> 01:06:00,105
LARRY ON PHONE : Where is it ?

568
01:06:00,189 --> 01:06:02,358
Where was it ? They closed it down .

569
01:06:02,441 --> 01:06:04,652
But it was in New York . It 's where the Mayflower used to be .

570
01:06:04,735 --> 01:06:06,820
The Mayflower ? The department store ?

571
01:06:06,904 --> 01:06:09,198
Do you have any idea where they would store records for a hospital

572
01:06:09,281 --> 01:06:11,450
that 's been closed for over 50 years ?

573
01:06:11,533 --> 01:06:13,994
No , I don 't . But I can send someone to city hall to check it out .

574
01:06:14,078 --> 01:06:17,998
If it 's a public hospital , there 'd be a record of it . Tell me exactly what you need .

575
01:06:18,082 --> 01:06:21,710
Same thing . I 'm looking for a patient or an employee with the name Esseker .

576
01:06:21,794 --> 01:06:26,382
All right , I 'm on it . Give me a couple hours , and , Ben , keep your head down .

577
01:06:37,976 --> 01:06:39,770
( THUNDER RUMBLING )

578
01:06:46,777 --> 01:06:48,612
( CAR DOOR OPENING )

579
01:06:49,237 --> 01:06:50,280
Hey .

580
01:06:50,364 --> 01:06:52,824
- Did you get it ? - Yeah , I think so .

581
01:06:53,617 --> 01:06:56,662
It 's Anna Esseker .

582
01:06:58,330 --> 01:07:00,582
I didn 't really know what you wanted , so I got all the medical files .

583
01:07:00,665 --> 01:07:03,752
This is perfect , Larry . This is perfect .

584
01:07:03,835 --> 01:07:06,671
What happened ? Did you get in an accident ?

585
01:07:06,755 --> 01:07:08,924
Anna Esseker 's file , did you have to go to city hall for it ?

586
01:07:09,007 --> 01:07:10,425
No , I didn 't have to go anywhere .

587
01:07:10,509 --> 01:07:13,428
All the files in that place were in storage with the cold-case evidence .

588
01:07:13,512 --> 01:07:14,679
Why , because of the fire ?

589
01:07:14,763 --> 01:07:18,433
No , it 's before the fire . It 's a totally different case .

590
01:07:19,100 --> 01:07:20,769
Anna was a patient at St. Matthew 's .

591
01:07:20,852 --> 01:07:23,438
She was in the psych ward run by a Dr. Kane .

592
01:07:23,521 --> 01:07:26,650
Now get this , she was only 12 years old when she died .

593
01:07:26,733 --> 01:07:27,817
What ?

594
01:07:27,901 --> 01:07:31,780
When the nurses went on their rounds first thing in the morning , October 6 , 1952 ,

595
01:07:31,863 --> 01:07:34,824
they discovered that all the patients had left their rooms during the night ,

596
01:07:34,908 --> 01:07:36,910
and they 'd all gathered in the main hall .

597
01:07:36,993 --> 01:07:39,579
Ben , they were all dead , including the girl .

598
01:07:39,662 --> 01:07:43,124
Apparently , they killed each other . I mean , it was a slaughterhouse .

599
01:07:43,208 --> 01:07:45,585
That 's when they closed the place down . Who knows what really happened ?

600
01:07:45,668 --> 01:07:48,004
- What about the doctor ? Kane ? - Well , they arrested him .

601
01:07:48,087 --> 01:07:49,964
They found him dead first day of the hearing .

602
01:07:50,048 --> 01:07:53,468
He slashed his wrists with a piece of the cell mirror .

603
01:07:54,761 --> 01:07:57,430
- Thanks for your help . - Good luck .

604
01:08:03,645 --> 01:08:04,896
Damn it !

605
01:08:09,609 --> 01:08:11,444
( THUNDER RUMBLING )

606
01:08:41,766 --> 01:08:43,059
Jesus .

607
01:08:59,283 --> 01:09:00,951
" October 6 , 1952 . "

608
01:09:05,414 --> 01:09:08,959
" Anna Esseker is diagnosed with severe schizophrenia ,

609
01:09:09,043 --> 01:09:13,339
" leading to withdrawal from reality , delusional and violent behavior . "

610
01:09:24,183 --> 01:09:26,810
" Pennsylvania , August 1951 . "

611
01:09:45,537 --> 01:09:46,997
They don 't match .

612
01:09:49,249 --> 01:09:53,378
Anna Esseker was discharged from St. Matthew 's Hospital October 4 .

613
01:09:53,462 --> 01:09:54,713
Two days before the massacre .

614
01:09:54,796 --> 01:09:56,798
( GLASS CRACKS )

615
01:10:17,861 --> 01:10:20,113
She 's alive , isn 't she ?

616
01:10:34,669 --> 01:10:38,048
You almost done , sweetie ? Okay .

617
01:10:38,131 --> 01:10:42,552
MICHAEL : Why is Daddy acting so scared ? It 's not normal .

618
01:10:44,137 --> 01:10:46,931
He 's way older than me .

619
01:10:47,474 --> 01:10:51,060
And I 'm not acting scared , but he is .

620
01:10:52,312 --> 01:10:56,983
- Doesn 't make any sense . - Michael ? What are you doing ?

621
01:10:58,026 --> 01:10:59,235
Nothing .

622
01:11:00,069 --> 01:11:03,740
- Okay , well , we gotta get going , all right ? - Okay .

623
01:11:05,199 --> 01:11:06,826
( GASPING )

624
01:11:15,960 --> 01:11:17,462
( SHUDDERING )

625
01:11:33,102 --> 01:11:34,937
( CELL PHONE RINGING )

626
01:11:36,856 --> 01:11:39,358
- Amy ? Amy , what 's wrong ? - AMY : Ben .

627
01:11:39,442 --> 01:11:42,236
You have to come to the house right now .

628
01:11:42,320 --> 01:11:43,905
( SOBBING ) I 'm so scared .

629
01:11:43,988 --> 01:11:46,866
- BEN : Amy , what 's wrong ? - I 'm so scared .

630
01:11:46,949 --> 01:11:50,202
- Amy , just tell me what happened . - There 's something in the house .

631
01:11:51,746 --> 01:11:54,373
- Something in the mirrors . - I 'm on my way .

632
01:11:55,041 --> 01:11:56,542
God damn it !

633
01:11:57,960 --> 01:11:59,587
( CAR HONKING )

634
01:12:02,965 --> 01:12:04,216
Come on .

635
01:12:54,933 --> 01:12:58,353
DAISY : Dad ? When are you coming back home ?

636
01:12:58,437 --> 01:13:00,564
BEN : Really soon , sweetheart . Come here .

637
01:13:03,859 --> 01:13:06,570
- I love you , Daddy . - BEN : I love you , too , sweetheart .

638
01:13:06,653 --> 01:13:08,196
I gotta go .

639
01:13:08,697 --> 01:13:10,490
I 'm afraid to stay here .

640
01:13:10,574 --> 01:13:12,534
There 's gonna be windows and mirrors wherever you go .

641
01:13:12,617 --> 01:13:15,036
Anything that causes a reflection right now is dangerous .

642
01:13:15,120 --> 01:13:17,122
At least inside the house we 've covered everything .

643
01:13:17,205 --> 01:13:19,374
It 's the safest place to be .

644
01:13:20,292 --> 01:13:21,418
Amy , I 'm so sorry .

645
01:13:21,543 --> 01:13:25,005
No . It 's not your fault . I should 've believed you .

646
01:13:26,756 --> 01:13:28,091
Come here .

647
01:13:32,012 --> 01:13:35,056
Ben , you do whatever it takes to end this .

648
01:13:36,224 --> 01:13:38,643
- You hear me ? - I will .

649
01:13:40,645 --> 01:13:42,480
I 'll be right back .

650
01:13:48,111 --> 01:13:50,071
( CAR ENGINE STARTING )

651
01:14:45,918 --> 01:14:47,753
( CROW CAWING )

652
01:15:35,843 --> 01:15:37,386
( DOG BARKING )

653
01:15:38,095 --> 01:15:39,680
BEN : Jesus .

654
01:15:41,724 --> 01:15:43,267
BOY : Yes , sir ?

655
01:15:43,350 --> 01:15:46,812
Excuse me . Is this the Esseker farm ?

656
01:15:46,895 --> 01:15:49,606
- WOMAN : What is it , Jimmy ? - I don 't know , Ma .

657
01:15:50,149 --> 01:15:54,319
- What can I do for you , sir ? - I 'm looking for Anna . Anna Esseker .

658
01:15:55,028 --> 01:15:57,656
There 's a man looking for ... You said Anna ?

659
01:15:57,739 --> 01:15:59,366
Yes , Anna Esseker .

660
01:15:59,449 --> 01:16:01,368
An Anna Esseker , Ma .

661
01:16:03,120 --> 01:16:06,957
Look , I 'm sorry to bother you . I must have the wrong place .

662
01:16:08,792 --> 01:16:11,503
What is it you want with Anna Esseker ?

663
01:16:17,718 --> 01:16:20,554
I 'm doing a research paper on schizophrenia .

664
01:16:20,637 --> 01:16:23,223
I became familiar with Anna Esseker 's case .

665
01:16:23,306 --> 01:16:25,642
I just wanted to ask her some questions .

666
01:16:27,060 --> 01:16:30,814
Go tell Grandpa there 's a man here who 's asking about his sister .

667
01:16:30,897 --> 01:16:32,107
BOY : Okay .

668
01:16:32,732 --> 01:16:34,192
BEN : Thank you .

669
01:16:34,276 --> 01:16:35,569
BOY : Grandpa ?

670
01:16:37,195 --> 01:16:39,406
ROBERT : You know , up to this day ,

671
01:16:39,489 --> 01:16:42,867
visions of Anna 's fits still haunt me at night .

672
01:16:44,327 --> 01:16:49,249
I helped my father fix up this part of the basement especially for her .

673
01:16:51,376 --> 01:16:53,336
Her fits were too violent .

674
01:16:53,420 --> 01:16:56,339
My mother couldn 't take her screams anymore .

675
01:16:56,423 --> 01:16:58,091
( ANNA SCREAMING )

676
01:17:04,514 --> 01:17:08,643
We had every priest , doctor , healer , coming in from all over the county ,

677
01:17:08,726 --> 01:17:10,061
but no one could help her .

678
01:17:25,576 --> 01:17:32,417
So finally , a Dr. Kane from New York answered my parents ' cries for help .

679
01:17:34,627 --> 01:17:38,548
He rejected the idea of demonic possession , said he didn 't believe in it .

680
01:17:38,631 --> 01:17:43,261
He was convinced Anna suffered from a rare form of personality disorder

681
01:17:44,428 --> 01:17:46,806
and mirrors could help her .

682
01:17:47,723 --> 01:17:51,227
He wanted Anna under his care , at St. Matthew 's .

683
01:17:52,228 --> 01:17:54,397
My parents were very poor ,

684
01:17:54,480 --> 01:17:57,858
but he agreed to cover all the costs of the hospital .

685
01:17:58,401 --> 01:18:00,486
Where did she go after the hospital ?

686
01:18:00,569 --> 01:18:01,946
Don 't you know ?

687
01:18:02,029 --> 01:18:04,657
She died there with all of Kane 's other patients .

688
01:18:04,740 --> 01:18:07,159
Mr. Esseker , I read the file .

689
01:18:07,243 --> 01:18:09,954
Anna left the hospital two days before the massacre .

690
01:18:10,037 --> 01:18:13,541
Dr. Kane altered the documents so she could disappear .

691
01:18:15,751 --> 01:18:17,211
Where did you get that document ?

692
01:18:17,294 --> 01:18:20,756
I need you to tell me where she went after St. Matthew 's .

693
01:18:21,423 --> 01:18:23,801
She came back and stayed with us for a while .

694
01:18:23,884 --> 01:18:28,138
What do you mean for a while ? What happened ? Why did she leave ?

695
01:18:28,222 --> 01:18:30,975
- I don 't want to talk about that . - Why did she leave ?

696
01:18:32,476 --> 01:18:35,145
Because strange things started to happen in the house .

697
01:18:35,229 --> 01:18:36,313
With Anna ?

698
01:18:36,397 --> 01:18:39,858
No , no , not with Anna anymore . No , she was totally cured .

699
01:18:41,902 --> 01:18:45,447
( WHISPERING ) Strange things started to happen with the mirrors , didn 't they ?

700
01:18:45,531 --> 01:18:48,784
Mr. Esseker , I need to know where Anna is now . It 's a matter of life and death .

701
01:18:48,867 --> 01:18:51,203
Do not make me threaten you .

702
01:18:51,286 --> 01:18:56,291
We sent her somewhere where mirrors are forbidden .

703
01:18:57,334 --> 01:19:01,213
- Where the mirrors couldn 't find her . - Where ? Where ?

704
01:19:02,381 --> 01:19:05,759
St. Augustine 's Monastery , on the road to Reedfield .

705
01:19:45,674 --> 01:19:47,968
( CHURCH BELL TOLLING )

706
01:20:08,363 --> 01:20:10,031
SISTER : How can I help you ?

707
01:20:11,491 --> 01:20:13,034
I 'm sorry to disturb you , Sister ,

708
01:20:13,117 --> 01:20:17,372
but I 've come to speak with a member of your community . Anna Esseker .

709
01:20:17,747 --> 01:20:19,832
Is she expecting you ?

710
01:20:20,083 --> 01:20:21,376
No , not really .

711
01:20:21,459 --> 01:20:24,337
If you 're not listed , I cannot help you , sir .

712
01:20:24,420 --> 01:20:28,508
Can you at least tell her that I 've come from New York

713
01:20:29,050 --> 01:20:30,593
to speak with her ?

714
01:20:30,677 --> 01:20:33,930
I work with Dr. Kane from St. Matthew 's Hospital .

715
01:20:34,806 --> 01:20:37,016
It 's very important , please .

716
01:20:41,604 --> 01:20:42,814
( DOOR CLOSING )

717
01:20:42,897 --> 01:20:47,151
ANNA : St. Matthew 's closed down in 1952 . Who are you ?

718
01:20:47,235 --> 01:20:49,403
BEN : My name is Benjamin Carson .

719
01:20:49,821 --> 01:20:53,616
I work as a night watchman on Sixth Avenue in New York City

720
01:20:53,699 --> 01:20:56,994
in the building that used to be St. Matthew 's Hospital .

721
01:20:57,078 --> 01:20:59,622
ANNA : What is it you want , Mr. Carson ?

722
01:21:00,039 --> 01:21:01,916
BEN : My family is in danger ,

723
01:21:01,999 --> 01:21:04,585
and what 's threatening them is asking for you .

724
01:21:04,669 --> 01:21:08,881
I came all this way to ask you

725
01:21:08,965 --> 01:21:11,175
why the mirrors that were left over from St. Matthew 's Hospital

726
01:21:11,258 --> 01:21:13,511
are so desperate to find you .

727
01:21:14,804 --> 01:21:16,555
Please , Miss Esseker .

728
01:21:17,181 --> 01:21:18,933
If you don 't help me ,

729
01:21:19,016 --> 01:21:21,352
I 'm gonna lose the most important thing to me in this world ,

730
01:21:21,435 --> 01:21:23,104
and that 's my family .

731
01:21:26,774 --> 01:21:28,692
Sit down , Mr. Carson .

732
01:21:37,785 --> 01:21:40,746
The mirrors are merely windows on our world .

733
01:21:41,997 --> 01:21:44,875
It is not the wish of the mirrors to find me

734
01:21:45,959 --> 01:21:47,211
but of what is imprisoned inside them .

735
01:21:49,046 --> 01:21:51,131
What is imprisoned inside them ?

736
01:21:52,424 --> 01:21:55,844
At the time that I was at St. Matthew 's ,

737
01:21:55,928 --> 01:21:56,970
( ANNA SCREAMING )

738
01:21:57,054 --> 01:22:00,557
Dr. Kane 's therapy for personality disorders

739
01:22:00,641 --> 01:22:05,479
consisted of locking the patient up in a mirrored room

740
01:22:05,562 --> 01:22:11,735
for several days on end , forcing them to confront their own image .

741
01:22:13,987 --> 01:22:17,199
Dr. Kane was wrong about his theory .

742
01:22:17,699 --> 01:22:21,411
There is no cure for schizophrenia , Mr. Carson .

743
01:22:21,495 --> 01:22:22,704
( ROARING )

744
01:22:24,498 --> 01:22:26,958
It was something else .

745
01:22:27,626 --> 01:22:33,673
And whatever it was , it left me and entered the mirrors .

746
01:22:33,757 --> 01:22:35,175
( SCREAMING )

747
01:22:35,550 --> 01:22:36,968
